Z||000000||1FST2M6||11-02-2001||02:07 PM||||well Msweldon and i had lunch and we were comming back from looking at his turbo MKII. when this blah looking 91 240sx pulls up next to us... were at a light and the kids all pipe shooting us.. well the light turns and the kids rear just goes up in smoke... as we pull 2-3 cars on him hit 2nd and he's gaining.. i flipped the switch and the nitrous was flowing ... he's still gaining...  were on a 5 lane rd in an industrial park and running about 70 now aaagh hes RIGHT next to me bangs 4th cocks sideways and leaves me like i had shut the car off.   well i backed off.. he backed off and i rolled by him at the next light..  when in the front of the car theres a spearco sticker and a Balanced Performance decal (Engineereds only competition)  i gave him the wave as marc exlaims.. SEE YOU NEVER KNOW!!   <P>well last night was a show at MSP (local shop) and he was there..  plain faded red 240sx.. with an SR20DET it makes 462hp 385lbft (2liter turbo) at the wheels a AND he's spraying!!! i didn't feel so bad.. he's a decent guy we're going to the race track tonite with the Focus club... lets see what he runs...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  if he can hook up.  god what a sweet unasuming ride! ||||reg||1
